      "text": "# dsh-provider-quota bundle patch: inserts the plugin row into the web profile\n# roster. Applied as a profile bundle layer (the `dsh.bundle.patch` manifest\n# field) over dsh-base; activate with\n# `dsh plugin --profile web add <path-to-package>` plus adding the package to\n# `dsh.profile.bundles` in the profile's package.json.\n#\n# The row is a bare plugin by package name: the node half (exports \".\") runs\n# in the host process (the provider-quota routes + system-prompt\n# announcement), and the `dsh.client` declaration in package.json makes the\n# browser half (exports \"./client\", served at /plugins/<id>/client.js) load in\n# the web GUI.\n- insert:\n    - id: provider-quota\n      name: '@guyunli/dsh-provider-quota'\n"
    }
